title: The refresh reports nothing, so what a request drew is judged around it, in the rerender pass.
pid: ea26532d-ec40-40f6-b6e5-2741a038dea1
body: |2-
  A save's rerender notes what it must answer for before 'refresh_view' and
  looks again after it. 'no_other_containers_warning' in 'server/rerender_pass.rs'
  does so for a containers request that drew no folder, and says "No other
  containers." in the save-result's warnings. Not the clients: a client cannot
  tell a folder pruned from one never drawn, both clients and the AI reader would
  each have to guess, and the warnings already reach all three. Decided
  2026-11-13, answering Libby's question on Vic's plan.
